Hello <%= @vendor.business_name %>,

You have a new booking request from <%= @customer.user.name %> for <%= @service.name %>.

Booking Details:
- Customer: <%= @customer.user.name %> (<%= @customer.user.email %>)
- Service: <%= @service.name %>
- Date & Time: <%= format_booking_time(@booking) %>
- Duration: <%= time_duration(@booking.event_date, @booking.event_end_date || @booking.event_date + 2.hours) %>
- Location: <%= @booking.event_location %>
- Total Amount: Rs. <%= number_with_precision(@booking.total_amount, precision: 2) %>

Manage Booking: <%= @view_booking_url %>

Best regards,
The Ayoj Team
